('water','Hydrogen bond','An attraction between a slightly positive hydrogen and a nearby slightly negative atom.','An attraction involving a hydrogen bonded to an electronegative atom and a nearby electronegative atom.','A noncovalent attraction involving hydrogen covalently bonded to an electronegative atom and an electronegative acceptor.'),
